a week has passed since destiny has  released and you may be struggling to  get better gear but here are a few spots  you can farm to hopefully get you some  Legendary's the first spot is on the  moon and the mission is a dark beyond  make sure to choose the level 9  difficulty follows dinklebot until you  reach the dead guardian which will thank  you a cutscene the doors of the temple  of crota will open and you will be  swarmed by the hive make sure to consume  black wax if you have this as it will  receive extra glimmer from killing the  hive creatures kill as many other hive  as you can and make sure to focus on the  hallowed acolytes as they are worth a  good amount of glimmer in addition make  sure to pick up silken codex which will  give you 200 glimmer on turning a key  tip on this run is to not kill the  hallowed Knight as it will cause the  endless wave of pipe to stop also you  need them to kill you so that you can  repeat the area over and over keep  killing the swarming hive to earn up to  a hundred plus glimmer per run as well  as many engrams more on what to do with  glimmer later on in this video if this  part isn't doing it for you there's  another quest on the moon called the  shrine of Oryx make sure to choose the  level 12 difficulty the shrine of Oryx  has two different areas where you can  farm that will give you 250 plus glimmer  per run and will give you the added  bonus of many silk and codex drops  follow dinklebot until you reach the  halls of wisdom here you are running to  chosen knights chosen acolytes and some  dregs that are fighting just beyond that  are hollowed acolytes and a hollowed  wizard kill them all jump into the abyss  and then repeat the area over and over  again until you've maxed out on  glimmering again make sure to use black  wax for more glimmer output if you get  bored of the halls of wisdom you can go  further into the shrine of Oryx here  you'll find some dregs and hallowed  acolytes battling it out after you've  proceeded to kill that eight hallowed  acolytes you'll find that there's  actually a hallowed ogre in here as well  after dealing with the hallowed odor and  some stray hive make a run and jump into  the lava and repeat the area again make  sure to consume the black wax again as  it'll buff your glimmer output again  kill die loot rinse and repeat now to  talk about what to do with all that  sweet glimmer you farmed go to the crypt  dark and turn in any of the Silk'n codex  you have and  code any blue or legendary engrams you  found if you found a legendary hold your  breath  cross your fingers and hope you get a  legendary well that didn't quite worked  out but now we try strategy number two  take your glimmer and purchase the green  items from the Crypt art until you run  out of glimmer the hope is that you're  able to level your crypt dark which will  then reward you with a present from the  crypt dark at the postmaster this  package can have up to three Legendary's  in it or sometimes none at all however  chances are you'll at least get one here  we got one so let's hold our breath  cross our fingers and boom goes the  dynamite we got one good luck farming  the crypt dark isn't as bad of a guy as  the internet makes them out to be  you
 

